@startuml UC14_DeleteAccount
title UC14 - User deletes account
actor "Registered User" as User
participant "BBP System" as System

autonumber
' Entry: User is on profile page

User -> System: Clicks "Delete account" button
activate System
System -> User: Asks for confirmation
deactivate System

User -> System: Confirms account deletion
activate System

alt Connection OK
    System -> System: Deletes user account and associated data
    System -> User: Returns to Home Page
    note right: Exit Condition: Account deleted & User disconnected
else Exception: Connection error
    System --> User: Error: Connection failed
end

deactivate System
@enduml